# ── Abacus web app sync (see docs/ACCESS-SETUP.md) ───────────────────────
# The app source is welcome; its build output, dependencies and SECRETS are
# not. Anything matching these must never arrive in a commit.
nextjs_space/node_modules/
nextjs_space/.next/
nextjs_space/out/
nextjs_space/.vercel/
nextjs_space/.env
nextjs_space/.env.*
!nextjs_space/.env.example
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/serviceAccount*.json
**/firebase-adminsdk*.json
